abstract: >
  Reproducibility repository for a locus-resolved integrative analysis
  of 13 curated functionally supported Gli3 limb enhancers and 41
  VISTA Gli3-region comparison elements with reported non-limb activity
  and no limb annotation in the source records. The comparison elements
  are not treated as experimentally established universal limb-negative
  controls. The repository includes figure- and table-level processed
  outputs, provenance documentation, build-aware genomic resources,
  scripts, and manuscript-associated assets. Chromatin,
  transcription-factor occupancy, and chromosome-contact datasets
  provide contextual and correlative evidence rather than direct
  evidence of regulatory mechanism. Rank-percentile and empirical AUC
  analyses describe molecular heterogeneity and overlap between the
  predefined enhancer sets without claiming predictive performance.
